{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-06-22 08:00:00', 'title': 'FIRST PROCEDURE IN THE WORLD WITH MEDTRONIC HUGO™ ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY SYSTEM PERFORMED AT CLÍNICA SANTA MARIA IN CHILE', 'text': 'THE ROBOTIC PROSTATECTOMY MARKED THE START OF THE HUGO™\xa0RAS SYSTEM GLOBAL PATIENT REGISTRY DUBLIN, JUNE 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FIRST PATIENT PROCEDURE WITH THE HUGO™ ROBOTIC-ASSISTED SURGERY (RAS) SYSTEM. THE ROBOTIC PROSTATECTOMY WAS PERFORMED JUNE 19 BY UROLOGICAL SURGEON RUBEN OLIVARES, M.D.'}